  - m_Id: 313253913
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151131230208
    m_Localized: Good morning! The garden beds are calling. What can I do for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590336
    m_Localized: Tell me about yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590337
    m_Localized: What do you think of this valley?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590338
    m_Localized: Give me a planting tip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590339
    m_Localized: What are you keeping so close to your heart?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590340
    m_Localized: "I'm a farmer's daughter from the eastern valley. I learned to plant
      before I learned to write. But the drought spares no one \u2014 I ended up
      here after losing everything."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590341
    m_Localized: That must have been hard to start over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590342
    m_Localized: You've adapted well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590343
    m_Localized: It was. But the soil here has something special about it. It welcomed
      me in a way the eastern valley never did. Maybe this is what I call home now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590344
    m_Localized: "It took a while. Every soil is different \u2014 it has its own
      ways. But I learned to listen to what the land asks of me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590345
    m_Localized: "This valley has history. People come, plant, harvest and leave.
      Few stay. Something here keeps you \u2014 the land, the rhythm of the seasons,
      I don't know."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590346
    m_Localized: Is there something mystical about this land?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590347
    m_Localized: I understand that feeling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590348
    m_Localized: "They say a druid blessed the deepest layers of soil here. I don't
      know if I believe it, but the plants grow too fast to just be the climate.
      Take good care of your beds' fertility \u2014 it's more valuable than it looks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590349
    m_Localized: Good. That means you came to stay. The best harvests come from those
      who plant with intention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590350
    m_Localized: "Tip of the day: soil gets tired. Every harvest takes a little fertility
      away. The less fertile it is, the less you yield. Let the soil rest or use
      fertilizer \u2014 though I don't sell that yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590351
    m_Localized: What about seasonal restrictions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590352
    m_Localized: Thanks for the tip!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590353
    m_Localized: Every plant has its preferred season. Carrot and cabbage in Spring,
      tomato in Summer, pumpkin in Fall, radish in Spring or Fall. Try planting out
      of season and the land will refuse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590354
    m_Localized: "You asked... so I'll tell you. I have a seed in my pocket I've
      never planted. It was my father's. I don't know what plant it is \u2014 and
      I don't have the courage to find out, because if it dies, I'll lose the last
      thing I have left of him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590355
    m_Localized: You should plant it. It's what he would have wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590356
    m_Localized: Keep it as a memory. It belongs to her too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590357
    m_Localized: Maybe you're right. When I have the courage, you'll be the first
      to know. I promise. Thank you... truly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590358
    m_Localized: You're... right too. Some things are better kept. But it's good
      to be able to talk about it with someone who understands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590359
    m_Localized: I trust you more than anyone in this valley. There's something I
      want to show you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590360
    m_Localized: "This seed... I found it in my father's coat pocket the day he died.
      I never knew what plant it was. I never had the courage to plant it \u2014
      what if I lost the last thing I have left of him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590361
    m_Localized: You should plant it. It's what he would have wanted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590362
    m_Localized: You don't have to plant it. Keep it as a memory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590363
    m_Localized: Maybe you're right. He loved watching things grow. When I have the
      courage, you'll be the first to know. Thank you... truly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590364
    m_Localized: You're... right too. Some things are better kept in the heart. But
      it's good to be able to talk about it with someone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590365
    m_Localized: Accept this as a gift. I always keep a special batch of seeds for
      the day I find someone I can trust. That day has come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590366
    m_Localized: Ah, you again! You know, few people bother to stop and talk. I'm
      glad you're different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590367
    m_Localized: I ended up here after a drought that destroyed everything I planted
      in the eastern valley. I lost three harvests in a row. But the soil here...
      it received me differently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590368
    m_Localized: What's so special about this soil?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590369
    m_Localized: Didn't you feel like giving up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590370
    m_Localized: There's something in the roots here, in the deepest layers. They
      say an ancient druid blessed the entire valley. I don't know if I believe in
      stories, but the plants grow too fast to just be luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590371
    m_Localized: 'Many times. But my mother always said: the seed that survives winter
      blooms stronger. I ended up believing it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590372
    m_Localized: "If you treat the land well, it gives back. Take care of your beds'
      fertility \u2014 tired soil gives less. Natural fertilizers help, but what
      works best is not rushing the process."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590373
    m_Localized: Oh! This is... you didn't have to. But I'm so glad you did. Rarely
      does anyone think of me like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590374
    m_Localized: "I'll keep it safe. And may you harvest twice what you sow this
      season \u2014 that's what I can give back right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590375
    m_Localized: "Spring! This is the best time to start. Carrots and radishes come
      up quickly \u2014 if you haven't planted yet, hurry before the soil cools down
      again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590376
    m_Localized: Which seeds do you recommend right now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590377
    m_Localized: Thanks for the tip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590378
    m_Localized: "Carrot and cabbage are my bet. They grow fast, sell well, and refresh
      the soil for summer. Avoid pumpkin for now \u2014 it's finicky and only blooms
      in fall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590379
    m_Localized: Give a gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590380
    m_Localized: Give a gift (already gifted today)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590381
    m_Localized: View relationship
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2613151160590382
    m_Localized: Browse seeds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369969692672
    m_Localized: Trouble in Sunny Fields
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664192
    m_Localized: Something's been spooking the animals near Sunny Fields. Take your
      team out there and clear it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664193
    m_Localized: Clear Sunny Fields
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664194
    m_Localized: Egg Collector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664195
    m_Localized: "Your chickens are laying \u2014 collect a few eggs for the pantry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664196
    m_Localized: Collect Eggs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664197
    m_Localized: First Harvest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664198
    m_Localized: Till some soil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664199
    m_Localized: Harvest a Carrot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664200
    m_Localized: Getting to Know Maren
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664201
    m_Localized: Maren's new in town too. Stop by and say hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664202
    m_Localized: Talk to Maren
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664203
    m_Localized: Welcome Harvest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664204
    m_Localized: Harvest 3 carrots to get your farm started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664205
    m_Localized: Harvest 3 carrots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664206
    m_Localized: First Victory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664207
    m_Localized: Win your first battle in the Meadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664208
    m_Localized: Win a Meadow battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630369990664209
